WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.247 --> 00:00:03.142
- The single reason I woke
up today and have not,

00:00:03.142 --> 00:00:04.870
and don't do weekend events,

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.516
'cause that's my family time,

00:00:06.516 --> 00:00:08.811
I woke up this morning and got here today

00:00:08.811 --> 00:00:09.908
was to tell you one thing.

00:00:09.908 --> 00:00:14.297
Which is, I recommend it very seriously

00:00:14.297 --> 00:00:16.470
that you go home and think about the fact

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.995
that you should probably allocate

00:00:17.995 --> 00:00:19.884
the next three to four years of your life

00:00:19.884 --> 00:00:22.505
to try to execute on the
thing that you want to do

00:00:22.505 --> 00:00:24.436
for the fucking rest of your life.

00:00:24.436 --> 00:00:27.381
If you really want to do
the thing that drives you,

00:00:27.381 --> 00:00:29.128
that's when you get into the zone of like,

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:30.835
"Cool, I don't need to
live in the best place."

00:00:30.835 --> 00:00:33.070
"Cool, I'll commute from
a little further away."

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:35.366
"Cool, I'll team up
with four or five people

00:00:35.366 --> 00:00:36.808
and sleep on a couch."

00:00:36.808 --> 00:00:38.108
And I think that that to me

00:00:38.108 --> 00:00:39.612
is the part that's most interesting.

00:00:39.612 --> 00:00:41.543
The reason I'm willing to trade

00:00:41.543 --> 00:00:44.021
is because I know how awesome it feels

00:00:44.021 --> 00:00:45.200
to do what you love.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:46.805
It's what I've been able
to do my whole life.

00:00:46.805 --> 00:00:51.521
(techno music)

